            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Minimum requirements: (1) 10-layer circuit protection (input fuse, OVP, OCP, OTP, short-circuit, reverse-polarity, over-power, under-voltage lockout, ESD, surge). (2) 100% 8-hour full-load burn-in at 45°C ambient, not batch sampling. (3) UL 94 V-0 fire-retardant enclosure rated to 850°C glow wire. (4) IEC 62368-1 Ed.3 dual-sensor thermal derating. (5) 100% hipot (dielectric withstand) testing per unit. For GaN chargers: additional thermal imaging at 100% load. WOWOHCOOL's protocol achieves a field failure rate below 0.1% across millions of units. Red flag: factory that only does batch sampling or cannot provide burn-in test reports."
          }
        },
