            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "GB 47372-2026 is China's new mandatory safety standard for power banks and portable power sources under CCC (China Compulsory Certification), published March 2026 with transition ending March 31, 2027. It adds nail-penetration and thermal abuse tests not present in previous standards. Industry estimates: ~70% of low-end manufacturers will be eliminated. For OEM buyers: verify your factory is GB 47372-ready NOW, non-compliant factories face shutdown. WOWOHCOOL is already GB 47372-compliant, ensuring supply chain continuity for export buyers."
          }
